 ion to Switzerland (Swiss citizenship\, or permanent residency with regula
 r artistic activity in Switzerland)\; not open to practitioners without a 
 Swiss connection. AMOUNT: maximum CHF 25\,000. Submission deadline 1 Septe
 mber (23:59 CEST). Apply via the Pro Helvetia portal.\n\nOrganisation: Pro
  Helvetia (Swiss Arts Council)\nLocation: Cross-regionally established Swi
 tzerland-based visual artists\, photographers\, and architects\, and colle
 ctives.\nAward: Maximum CHF 25\,000. No application fee.\nDuration: Newly 
 created works presented publicly for the first time\; deadline 1 September
 .\n\nMore: https://prohelvetia.ch/en/find-support/grant-for-production-wit
 h-presentation?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
